# AdventureWorks Sales Performance Dashboard

## Overview

This project focuses on analyzing the sales performance of Adventure Works, a global manufacturing company specializing in cycling products including bikes, accessories, clothing, and components.

The goal of this project was not just to build a dashboard, but to solve business reporting challenges by tracking KPIs, identifying revenue trends, analyzing customer behavior, and supporting strategic decision-making through interactive reporting and visual analytics.

---

# Business Problem

Adventure Works required a centralized reporting solution to monitor business performance across sales, profit, orders, returns, customers, products, and geographic regions.

The company faced challenges in:
- Tracking sales and profitability trends across multiple years
- Monitoring KPI performance across product categories
- Identifying high-performing products and regions
- Understanding customer purchasing behavior
- Evaluating return rates and operational performance
- Supporting business decisions through data-driven reporting

This project was developed to transform raw business data into actionable insights using interactive dashboards and KPI reporting.

---

# Objective

The objective of this project was to:
- Monitor key business KPIs including revenue, profit, orders, and returns
- Analyze category-wise and regional sales performance
- Identify customer and product trends
- Evaluate monthly and yearly business growth
- Generate actionable business insights
- Support strategic decision-making through interactive reporting

