# Data Preparation & ETL Process

To prepare the dataset for reporting and analysis, ETL (Extract, Transform, Load) processes were performed using Power Query.

### Data Cleaning Steps:
- Header Promotion
- Data Type Formatting
- Calculated Columns Creation
- Null Value Replacement
- Column Merging and Extraction
- Folder Data Import
- Data Trimming
- Data Standardization
- Data Profiling
- Removal of Duplicate and Unwanted Columns

These processes improved data quality, consistency, and reporting accuracy.

