# Data Modeling

A structured data model was developed using:
- Star Schema
- Snowflake Schema

### Model Features:
- Fact and Dimension Table Relationships
- One-to-Many Cardinality
- Single Cross-Filter Direction
- Primary and Foreign Key Relationships
- Optimized Model Performance

The model ensured efficient reporting and seamless dashboard interactions.

