# Key Insights Generated

## Executive Insights

- Adventure Works generated $24.9 million in revenue and $10.5 million in profit from over 25,000 orders between 2020 and 2022.
- Bikes contributed the highest revenue and profit among all product categories.
- Accessories generated high order volumes but comparatively lower revenue contribution.

---

## Revenue Trend Insights

- Revenue increased significantly between 2020 and 2021 but declined slightly in 2022.
- COVID-19 impacted revenue growth during 2020 despite increased order volumes.
- Revenue recovery began in early 2021 as demand stabilized.

---

## Customer Insights

- Professionals and skilled manual workers contributed the highest number of orders.
- Average revenue per customer showed a declining trend over time.
- Maurice Shan emerged as the highest revenue-generating customer.

---

## Product Insights

- The “Fender Set Mountain” product failed to achieve monthly revenue and order KPIs.
- Price adjustment analysis provided insights into profit optimization opportunities.

---

## Geographic Insights

- USA generated the highest order volume, followed by Australia.
- United Kingdom emerged as the strongest European market.

