# Business Recommendations

## Recommendation 1
Increase focus on high-performing product categories such as Bikes to maximize profitability.

## Recommendation 2
Investigate declining revenue trends after 2021 and implement targeted growth strategies.

## Recommendation 3
Improve customer retention and upselling strategies to increase revenue per customer.

## Recommendation 4
Optimize pricing strategies using product-level profit analysis.

## Recommendation 5
Strengthen market expansion efforts in high-performing regions such as the USA and Australia.

